  "description": "PostgreSQL and pgvector storage for Mythosia VectorDb with Cosine, Euclidean and InnerProduct similarity, jsonb metadata filters, text-only retrieval and configurable normalized weighted RRF. Uses persisted full-text indexing and optional pg_trgm word_similarity for keyword search, including CJK text. Provides batch retrieval, counts, HNSW/IVFFlat/NoIndex settings, connection verification and schema provisioning. What's New in v10.8.0: Text and configurable hybrid search with corrected keyword syntax, trigram ordering and filters.",
