  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.8.0: Adds text-only retrieval and configurable normalized weighted RRF with filters and cancellation on active search legs. Fixes trigram ordering with word_similarity and stable record IDs, prevents dangling tsquery operators in natural-language keyword queries, and excludes missing metadata keys from empty NotIn conditions. Symbol-aware analyzer changes are outside this update. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/vectordb/Mythosia.VectorDb.Postgres/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v1080",
